# Supabase Storage does not use Firebase Storage rules. Configure the Firebase
# project as a Third-Party Auth provider in Supabase, then apply the policies
# documented in README.md to storage.objects through the Supabase SQL Editor.
#
# The Supabase bucket must be public because map objects persist getPublicUrl()
# results. RLS policies still restrict writes and object metadata operations to
# users/<Firebase UID>/... paths.
